         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Add SubframeQualityReview script. Asses subframe quality after an initial WBPP run and include comparison with master file and best subframe. Optional: add autofocus time information from an ASIAIR Autorun log file to check effects of re-focussing during image acquisition.
            </p>
